        "x": -644,
        "y": 0
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Reordering spreads\n\n`SortSpread` arranges numbers ascending/descending; `ShuffleSpread` permutes them deterministically by seed.\n\nA RandomSpread of 30 numbers, sorted, drawn as a bar chart. Try wiring the shuffle node back in instead.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 220
      },
